{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：Y在S12把想尽可能给予对方的一切改成了让对方安心，S14又增加了不后悔这一判断，人物动机和心理结论不如X准确、克制。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"X\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y用加亮关键词让人物每一阶段的核心变化更容易被瞬间抓住，感受又有具体的音乐节点对应，边听边扫时更容易把音乐变化和人物心理联系起来。尤其从最初不敢表达、被看见后的不安、逐渐放开，到最后接受无法保证永远，Y的音乐意象和时间呼应让整段经历更像一条连续发展的线。X的优势是人物为什么这样想、为什么改变写得更充分，心理因果和细微动机比Y更完整。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "4af723c8-5afb-438a-866b-a65e9d61ab1f", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261106T212052187397Z", "elapsed_seconds": 57.828, "completed_utc": "2026-11-06T21:21:50.027087+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "6633c5f7583a20a95259c3c65acfc99d373f3cada20cea277431bec3f4c5225e", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_atta